WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.732
Here we join patients to admissions and create monthly admission counts.

00:00:04.732 --> 00:00:08.802
The patient table contributes descriptive information.

00:00:08.802 --> 00:00:12.997
The admissions table contributes the events being counted.

00:00:12.997 --> 00:00:21.797
Because we understand the one to many relationship, we can group to one row per patient and create month specific

00:00:21.797 --> 00:00:27.467
counts. The join is safe because we know exactly which table contains the facts we are measuring.
